The roadmap is README.md; this file is not the roadmap. It records which of the
roadmap's headline theorems can be stated against the pinned APIs. None of the
following headlines is statable on those APIs with only simple definitions:

* Framed almost de Rham and regular lattice completion equivalences (Layers 1–2):
  missing coefficient B_dR representations, D_pdR, period lattices and their
