  Robba deformation functors and the Grothendieck incidence components.
* Galois component detection, indexing and tangent comparison (Layer 6): missing
  the localized trianguline condition and its period/Cartan maps.
* Analytic completed local-model identification (Layer 7): missing the rigid
  trianguline variety, its completed local ring and the incidence local model.
* Local normality, Cohen–Macaulayness and character flatness (Layers 7–8): missing
  that variety and its analytic character projections.
* Crystalline accumulation and the crystalline companion criterion (Layer 8):
  missing crystalline representations, refined deformation spaces and companion
  parameter points of the trianguline variety.
* Weight-fibre KL identity and full-character crystalline multiplicity formula
  (Layer 9): missing those analytic fibres, completed Steinberg cycle transfer
  and locally analytic principal-series constituents.
* Injection-line recovery of crystabelline Hodge parameters (Layer 10): missing
  crystabelline Robba modules, their canonical endpoints and their period data.
* Simultaneous-refinement derivative transport and paraboline product formulas
  (Layer 11): missing the actual Robba self-Ext spaces and refinement derivatives.
* Partial tangent modification and quotient comparison (Layer 12): missing
  embedding-selective Robba modification and partial de Rham extension spaces.
* Injection-image and matched-relation rigidity (Layer 13): missing those Robba
